<title>UK: BZW sets spread warrants on HSBC shares.</title>
<headline>BZW sets spread warrants on HSBC shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 50 million spread warrants on HSBC Holdings shares denominated in Hong Kong dollars (HSBC HK$10) and in sterling (HSBC 75p), lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>* * *</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     65 PENCE  REFERENCE INTRINSIC VALUE 65 PENCE</p>
<p>PAYOUT (UNDERLYING)  (HSBC HK$10 - HSBC 75P) + 100 BP</p>
<p> WARRANTS/SPREAD ONE			 EXERCISE PRICE ZERO</p>
<p> EXPIRY DATE     30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	20.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
